{"version":1,"content":"<p>對美國總統特朗普而言，股市長期是他經濟議程的晴雨表。他常常拿股市造勢，用來證明在自己任內人工智能產業蓬勃發展。因此，當醜聞席捲晶片巨頭英偉達、逼走CEO黃仁勳，並引發金融市場劇烈動蕩時，特朗普迅速出手幹預。他站出來為黃仁勳辯護，動用白宮的影響力，推動這位身陷風波的高管復職。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587766.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.194458+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:53:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"0f61cae79c4fabab417542e2da2abc9529d18ab4f5a20df1ab5aa44308a58e43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}